{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：05:05 2026-11-14 HKT<br/>發佈時間：05:05 2026-11-14 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：05:05 2026-11-14 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5d580cb487598221b3b7228440cc749a/2026-11/2026-11-13_00_13_04_0.png\"/><p>昨日(13日)晚上8時58分，長洲東灣一酒店職員報案，指發現姓羅(36歲)男租客倒臥在上址一洗手間，不醒人事，旁邊有一盆燃燒的炭，職員其後將火救熄並報警。</p><p>救援人員接報到場，事主昏迷被送往長洲醫院，其後由直升機轉送往東區尤德夫人那打素醫院治理。警員於現場沒有檢獲遺書，正追查其輕生原因。</p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T21:28:11.429933+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":226,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T21:05:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T22:42:28.762094+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T21:21:35.379296+00:00","content_hash":"acb96e7164143c6fc72beb7eaae127da69a9621630a7fd145d46d0bc3641f84f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}